---
/** Shown only in review builds (dev, or PUBLIC_REVIEW=true). */
---

<aside class="review-banner" aria-label="Review build notice">
  <p class="container">
    <span class="review-banner__tag">Review build</span>
    Highlighted items await confirmation and are removed from the production build. Draft projects are visible here only.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .review-banner {
    background: var(--pending);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .review-banner p {
    padding-block: var(--s-2);
  }

  .review-banner__tag {
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-right: var(--s-2);
  }
</style>
